<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/2/msa@/~cl_49__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/2/msa@/~cl_49> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/2/msa@> .
